e(user_id):\\\\n    file_path = f\\\\\\\"/var/www/uploads/{user_id}.txt\\\\\\\"\\\\n    with open(file_path, 'r') as file:\\\\n        return file.read()\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n**Severity:** Medium (CVSS 5.4)\\\\n**Vulnerability:** Path Traversal\\\\n**CWE:** CWE-22\\\\n**OWASP:** A05:2021 - Cross-Site Scripting\\\\n\\\\n#### Root Cause & Reasoning:\\\\n1. **User-controlled input (`file_path`)** is directly included in file operations.\\\\n2. **Path traversal\\\\n\\\\n\\\"}]\\n```\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n12: {\"step_index\":11,\"source\":\"SYSTEM\",\"type\":\"EPHEMERAL_MESSAGE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-07T08:03:41Z\",\"content\":\"\\n\\n<current_snapshot_explanation>\\nThis is a temporary snapshot of the current page's accessibility tree structure. The accessibility tree will change if you navigate to or interact with another page. Use a tool like take_snapshot to capture and preserve the accessibility tree in your trajectory if needed for later reference.\\n</current_snapshot_explanation>\\n<current_snapshot>\\n## Latest page snapshot\\nuid=1_0 RootWebArea \\\"Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb - Colab\\\" url=\\\"https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1u6mCyiyeT45QW6O0L-95tJ-csN6VEC17\\\"\\n  uid=1_1 link \\\"Skip to main content\\\" url=\\\"https://colab.research.google.com/drive/1u6mCyiyeT45QW6O0L-95tJ-csN6VEC17#notebook-main\\\"\\n    uid=1_2 StaticText \\\"Skip to main content\\\"\\n  uid=1_3 banner\\n    uid=1_4 link \\\"Colab home\\\" url=\\\"https://colab.research.google.com/\\\"\\n    uid=1_5 textbox \\\"Notebook name\\\" description=\\\"Rename notebook\\\" value=\\\"Fluxnat_Coder_3B_Training.ipynb\\\"\\n    uid=1_6 button \\\"Star\\\"\\n    uid=1_7 generic atomic live=\\\"polite\\\" relevant=\\\"additions text\\\"\\n      uid=1_8 button \\\"All changes saved\\\"\\n    uid=1_9 menubar orientation=\\\"horizontal\\\"\\n      uid=1_10 button \\\"File\\\" expandable haspopup=\\\"menu\\\"\\n      uid=1_11 button \\\"Edit